WEBVTT

00:01:35.670 --> 00:01:38.350
I remember everything now!

00:01:38.350 --> 00:01:46.670
I sealed my memories back then, because I didn't want him to take my memories of the Mermaid Princesses!

00:01:46.670 --> 00:01:50.760
Kaito... remembers everything.

00:01:51.090 --> 00:01:54.840
The person in front of me that I have to protect...

00:01:54.840 --> 00:01:58.820
...is you, Lucia!

00:01:58.820 --> 00:02:00.350
Kaito!

00:02:17.420 --> 00:02:18.980
The End of Despair

00:02:24.800 --> 00:02:27.910
Does it hurt? Are you sad?

00:02:27.910 --> 00:02:30.340
My poor other self.

00:02:30.340 --> 00:02:32.070
{However,}But you don't need to worry.

00:02:32.560 --> 00:02:39.040
For sure, I will make us a new world, for you and for me.

00:02:39.910 --> 00:02:41.720
My other self?

00:02:42.360 --> 00:02:46.030
Mikaru, you are no longer a human being.

00:02:47.510 --> 00:02:50.090
You cannot be on the ground.

00:02:50.750 --> 00:02:53.460
Now, release yourself.

00:02:53.950 --> 00:02:56.060
Come to me.

00:02:56.650 --> 00:03:00.960
What's wrong? Didn't you wish to be released from your pain, Mikaru?

00:03:01.650 --> 00:03:04.330
Now, come to me!

00:03:05.810 --> 00:03:09.280
Goodbye. Goodbye, Kaito!

00:03:23.350 --> 00:03:24.520
The time has come.

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:42.280
Now, Mikaru! Unite with me and {allow}make my body {to be }complete!

00:03:54.890 --> 00:03:56.190
This is for the best.

00:03:56.500 --> 00:04:02.800
It's better for me to disappear before Kaito despises me even more.

00:04:12.060 --> 00:04:13.590
I don't think so.

00:04:13.590 --> 00:04:15.150
You are no one other than yourself, Mikaru.

00:04:15.990 --> 00:04:19.720
Goodbye, Kaito. Thank you for everything.

00:04:20.050 --> 00:04:23.780
And... I still love you even now, Kaito.

00:04:31.820 --> 00:04:34.600
This is {wonderful}fantastic. This is truly wonderful!

00:04:55.650 --> 00:04:59.510
Mikeru has finally absorbed Mikaru into his own body.

00:04:59.510 --> 00:05:04.590
{In this way}With this, Mikeru-sama's rejection reactions can be cured{. He now has a complete body!} and his body will be complete.

00:05:04.890 --> 00:05:06.700
A complete body, huh?

00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:07.950
What's wrong?

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:11.730
Aren't you happy that everything has happened like you wanted?

00:05:29.110 --> 00:05:33.580
Oh, look what we have here. Mermaid Princesses.

00:05:34.040 --> 00:05:36.280
You're out awfully early this morning.

00:05:36.280 --> 00:05:37.050
Mikeru!

00:05:37.690 --> 00:05:40.790
Mikaru definitely wouldn't have expected that you'd be here, either.

00:05:40.790 --> 00:05:44.680
Mikeru, you know where Mikaru is, don't you?

00:05:44.680 --> 00:05:47.510
Does that mean Mikaru has been here before?

00:05:47.510 --> 00:05:48.490
Where is Mikaru?

00:05:52.160 --> 00:05:55.500
{Hold it}Hey! Quit laughing and answer us!

00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:57.770
Does that mean you did something to Mikaru?

00:05:58.280 --> 00:06:03.820
I have removed Mikaru's memories of suffering and sadness.

00:06:03.820 --> 00:06:06.980
Mikaru's memories of suffering and sadness?

00:06:06.980 --> 00:06:13.140
Lucia, you, of all people, should know Mikaru's suffering better than anyone.

00:06:16.580 --> 00:06:17.320
Mikaru...

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:27.170
Mikaru... no, I mean my other self, has discarded her wretched{abhorrent} human heart.

00:06:27.480 --> 00:06:29.470
Your other self?

00:06:29.470 --> 00:06:31.230
What's {in the world is }the meaning of this?

00:06:31.230 --> 00:06:37.350
Yes. From the beginning, Mikaru and I {are}have been of the same body, but of two hearts.

00:06:37.790 --> 00:06:42.710
Now {her}our heart has been restored to its original state.

00:06:43.100 --> 00:06:44.810
What are you talking about?

00:06:44.810 --> 00:06:46.720
{This is something I can hardly believe.}I can't believe it.

00:06:46.720 --> 00:06:51.260
Mikaru and Mikeru are two parts of {one}the same being.

00:06:51.700 --> 00:06:56.300
Now, Mikeru has absorbed Mikaru.

00:06:56.300 --> 00:07:01.680
N-No way! So then... what happened to Mikaru?

00:07:02.060 --> 00:07:05.530
For you, Mikaru was someone who was in your way.

00:07:06.040 --> 00:07:10.970
In order for her to have the sweet feeling of relief, she has {united}merged with me.

00:07:11.500 --> 00:07:14.670
This is for the sake of allowing me to have a complete body.

00:07:15.350 --> 00:07:16.620
That is her true wish.

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:20.480
I... I will definitely not allow this!

00:07:20.920 --> 00:07:23.670
Do you want to try to get Mikaru out of my body?

00:07:24.490 --> 00:07:30.260
With my complete body, your powers are of no use against me.

00:07:30.850 --> 00:07:32.530
Pink Pearl Voice!

00:07:36.900 --> 00:07:38.710
Aqua Pearl Voice!

00:07:43.220 --> 00:07:45.010
Green Pearl Voice!

00:07:49.910 --> 00:07:52.640
Pichi Pichi Voice Live Start!

00:09:17.910 --> 00:09:23.190
Did you think that song would have any effect on me?

00:09:25.890 --> 00:09:34.190
Since {I now have my complete body}my body is now complete, I don't need your power, Mermaid Princesses.

00:09:34.720 --> 00:09:40.660
As the last descendant of my ancient race, allies of the human race are in the way of me fulfilling my duty.

00:09:40.660 --> 00:09:42.730
The last descendant of an ancient race?

00:09:42.920 --> 00:09:44.330
{What's going on?}What are you talking about?

00:09:44.580 --> 00:09:50.240
If I get absorbed into Mikeru's body, I'll never be able to be with Kaito again!

00:09:50.240 --> 00:09:52.460
I don't want {this}that!

00:09:52.460 --> 00:09:54.860
I want to be with Kaito even more!

00:09:54.860 --> 00:09:56.210
Lucia!

00:09:56.470 --> 00:09:57.640
Lucia!

00:09:57.950 --> 00:10:01.520
LUCIA!!

00:10:01.520 --> 00:10:03.050
It's the light from that guy!

00:10:03.050 --> 00:10:05.040
Kaito!

00:10:58.050 --> 00:11:00.170
Why is Mikaru {with}in Mikeru's body?

00:11:04.170 --> 00:11:06.080
Get out of my way!

00:11:18.600 --> 00:11:25.000
My other self... is her heart still alive within my body?

00:11:50.930 --> 00:11:52.970
Kaito, are you all right?

00:11:52.970 --> 00:11:55.010
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:11:55.010 --> 00:11:58.000
In any case, Lucia... what in the world is going on?

00:11:58.000 --> 00:12:03.570
What happened was... Mikaru got absorbed into Mikeru's body.

00:12:03.570 --> 00:12:06.090
Huh? Mikaru is {within}inside Mikeru?

00:12:06.400 --> 00:12:10.790
I will find out what kind of a being I am.

00:12:11.290 --> 00:12:18.270
{For the purpose of escaping}In order to escape from this suffering and to make my power more perfect...

00:12:19.320 --> 00:12:22.940
...this person is {a roadblock!}in my way!

00:12:23.630 --> 00:12:26.000
How's that? Does it hurt?

00:12:26.000 --> 00:12:27.590
Does it make you sad?

00:12:27.590 --> 00:12:33.330
If you can {remove that power}release that energy from your body, though, you'll be free.

00:12:33.330 --> 00:12:37.920
So throw away everything and {merge}become one with me!

00:12:37.920 --> 00:12:40.830
You can be free of your soul this way!

00:12:43.630 --> 00:12:45.950
So that's what was going on.

00:12:45.950 --> 00:12:49.090
Kaito, do you know something?

00:12:49.090 --> 00:12:54.580
Yeah. I saw an illusion of Mikeru attempting to absorb Mikaru into his body before.

00:12:54.580 --> 00:12:58.260
{However,}But we now know Mikeru's true form.

00:12:58.260 --> 00:13:01.850
Yeah. Apparently, Mikeru's real form is Mikaru.

00:13:01.850 --> 00:13:02.920
That's not true!

00:13:03.410 --> 00:13:04.430
That's not true...

00:13:11.880 --> 00:13:19.280
When I was attacked by Mikeru in Hawaii, it was Mikaru who saved me and watched over me for many days.

00:13:20.970 --> 00:13:24.230
I can't believe Mikaru is Mikeru!

00:13:24.770 --> 00:13:25.510
Kaito.

00:13:28.620 --> 00:13:30.920
Kaito, that pendant...

00:13:31.430 --> 00:13:36.610
Lucia, this pendant has been with me ever since I met you.

00:13:37.040 --> 00:13:41.200
As long as I wear this pendant, it's like you're with me.

00:13:44.570 --> 00:13:47.870
{Mikaru returned it to me on her own volition.}Mikaru decided on her own to return it to me.

00:13:48.770 --> 00:13:53.280
I didn't realize it when she returned it to me.

00:13:53.280 --> 00:14:00.170
The Mikeru that attacked me and the Mikaru that saved me are completely different beings.

00:14:00.800 --> 00:14:04.220
Even then, I left Mikaru alone...

00:14:05.120 --> 00:14:10.040
Mikaru has felt loneliness all her life.

00:14:11.040 --> 00:14:11.980
Kaito...

00:14:12.440 --> 00:14:16.190
It's my fault that this has happened to Mikaru.

00:14:23.590 --> 00:14:24.540
That's...

00:14:24.540 --> 00:14:25.230
...Mikeru!

00:14:40.770 --> 00:14:42.430
Pink Pearl Voice!

00:14:46.180 --> 00:14:47.740
Aqua Pearl Voice!

00:14:50.310 --> 00:14:51.870
Green Pearl Voice!

00:15:38.980 --> 00:15:41.360
All right, let's go!

00:15:41.890 --> 00:15:45.010
Pichi Pichi Voice Live Start!

00:17:11.290 --> 00:17:15.410
The members of the Panterassa and Mermaid races are of the same noble blood as my ancient race.

00:17:15.780 --> 00:17:19.430
{Now, }They've since become contaminated with the human race.

00:17:20.350 --> 00:17:24.100
I will now purify these {contaminated}tainted souls!

00:17:31.580 --> 00:17:33.320
This is Mikeru's dimension.

00:17:35.920 --> 00:17:39.140
I will not let you escape this dimension!

00:17:41.250 --> 00:17:44.840
Now, I will {slowly torture you!}make you suffer!

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:51.260
W-What's that?

00:18:11.420 --> 00:18:12.210
Seira!

00:18:12.210 --> 00:18:13.280
This is...

00:18:13.280 --> 00:18:16.310
Is it that {damn}darn Orange Pearl Mermaid Princess?

00:19:02.870 --> 00:19:05.570
Lucia! This is your chance to run!

00:19:05.590 --> 00:19:08.960
But, Seira! How can I run and leave you behind?

00:19:08.960 --> 00:19:12.690
It'll be all right. {That's because }I believe in you, Lucia.

00:19:12.690 --> 00:19:17.340
I believe in the six Mermaid Princesses and in Aqua Regina-sama.

00:19:18.160 --> 00:19:19.250
Seira...

00:19:24.880 --> 00:19:28.580
{Therefore,}So you also have to believe in Kaito-kun.

00:19:28.580 --> 00:19:29.390
Huh?

00:19:29.390 --> 00:19:30.250
Seira.

00:19:30.250 --> 00:19:32.470
Please, Lucia!

00:20:19.460 --> 00:20:22.240
Seira saved us again.

00:20:23.210 --> 00:20:24.820
I'm sorry, Lucia.

00:20:24.820 --> 00:20:25.350
Huh?

00:20:25.890 --> 00:20:32.860
If Mikaru is now in Mikeru's body, I can't fight with you.

00:20:33.570 --> 00:20:34.720
Kaito!

00:20:34.720 --> 00:20:39.920
If I fight Mikeru, but it's Mikaru who gets hurt...

00:20:39.920 --> 00:20:42.550
I can't do it!

00:20:42.550 --> 00:20:43.520
Kaito...

00:20:43.520 --> 00:20:44.620
Kaito-kun!

00:20:44.620 --> 00:20:46.560
Kaito, you...

00:20:48.680 --> 00:20:50.010
I understand.

00:20:50.010 --> 00:20:51.920
But please listen to me, Kaito.

00:20:52.790 --> 00:20:57.250
Even if you're not with us, we'll still fight.

00:20:58.020 --> 00:21:01.460
Seira trusts that we'll save her from Mikeru,

00:21:01.460 --> 00:21:03.200
so we're going to rescue her.

00:21:04.220 --> 00:21:05.850
We'll fight Mikeru for {that}her.

00:21:06.260 --> 00:21:07.260
Lucia...

00:21:07.260 --> 00:21:11.320
Lucia, you... are you really sure about that?

00:21:11.320 --> 00:21:12.290
Lucia...

00:21:12.290 --> 00:21:13.080
Yeah.

00:21:13.610 --> 00:21:14.580
That's because...

00:21:15.550 --> 00:21:18.280
...I'm a Mermaid Princess!

00:21:36.430 --> 00:21:41.880
{The one with the }Oh, bearer of white feathers, we'll go and take care of the Mermaid Ladies.

00:21:41.880 --> 00:21:49.440
Now that I've got a complete body, I {do not}no longer need the assistance of the garbage like you!

00:21:52.450 --> 00:21:53.960
We're garbage?

00:21:53.960 --> 00:21:56.430
But, you're "garbage," too!

00:21:56.430 --> 00:21:57.280
What?

00:21:57.280 --> 00:22:00.110
We know your secret!

00:22:00.110 --> 00:22:02.080
You're just like us!

00:22:02.080 --> 00:22:05.240
You were created by the Great One as well! You're just a puppet!

00:22:10.350 --> 00:22:13.740
You say that I'm a puppet created by the Great One?

00:22:13.740 --> 00:22:14.760
That's stupid!

00:22:15.400 --> 00:22:18.770
I am the reincarnated ruler of this world!

00:23:52.610 --> 00:23:54.290
I'm the ruler of this world!

00:23:54.290 --> 00:23:56.210
I'm the ultimate diety!

00:23:56.440 --> 00:23:59.010
Mikeru, I feel sorry for you.

00:23:59.010 --> 00:23:59.910
What?

00:23:59.910 --> 00:24:02.760
In reality, aren't you also suffering?

00:24:02.760 --> 00:24:05.900
What are you saying, prisoner?

00:24:05.900 --> 00:24:07.460
That's because I understand.

00:24:07.460 --> 00:24:10.310
That's because I've been close to your heart all this time.

00:24:10.310 --> 00:24:13.700
Next time on Mermaid Melody Pichi Pichi Pitch Pure:

00:24:13.700 --> 00:24:15.690
To the Castle in the Sky.

00:24:15.690 --> 00:24:19.820
Lucia, destroy Mikeru's true form.
